{
  "name": "Turn web pages and YouTube videos into a NotebookLM podcast",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "NotebookLM podcast from your links",
        "formDescription": "Paste web pages or YouTube videos, one per line. Runs on your own Gemini Notebook (NotebookLM) account through the useapi.net API.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Title",
              "requiredField": true,
              "placeholder": "Weekly AI news roundup"
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Links",
              "fieldType": "textarea",
              "requiredField": true,
              "placeholder": "https://example.com/article\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=..."
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Format",
              "fieldType": "dropdown",
              "requiredField": true,
              "fieldOptions": {
                "values": [
                  {
                    "option": "deep_dive"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "brief"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "critique"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "debate"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Length",
              "fieldType": "dropdown",
              "requiredField": true,
              "fieldOptions": {
                "values": [
                  {
                    "option": "short"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "default"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "long"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Links form",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "f1a2b3c4-5d6e-4f70-8a9b-0c1d2e3f4a5b"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "name": "title",
              "value": "={{ $json.Title }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c2",
              "name": "urls",
              "value": "={{ $json.Links.split(/\\s+/).map(s => s.trim()).filter(s => /^https?:\\/\\//.test(s)).slice(0, 50) }}",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "c3",
              "name": "format",
              "value": "={{ $json.Format }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c4",
              "name": "length",
              "value": "={{ $json.Length }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c5",
              "name": "language",
              "value": "en",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c6",
              "name": "email",
              "value": "",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.useapi.net/v1/gemini-notebook/notebooks",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 320000
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify(Object.assign({ title: $('Settings').item.json.title }, $('Settings').item.json.email ? { email: $('Settings').item.json.email } : {})) }}"
      },
      "name": "Create notebook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "useapiHeaderAuth",
          "name": "useapi.net API token"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.useapi.net/v1/gemini-notebook/sources",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 320000
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ notebook: $('Create notebook').item.json.notebook, urls: $('Settings').item.json.urls }) }}"
      },
      "name": "Add sources",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "useapiHeaderAuth",
          "name": "useapi.net API token"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 10
      },
      "name": "Wait 10s",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        880,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "a2b3c4d5-6e7f-4a81-9b0c-1d2e3f4a5b6c"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ 'https://api.useapi.net/v1/gemini-notebook/notebooks/' + encodeURIComponent($('Create notebook').item.json.notebook) }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "name": "Check sources",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "useapiHeaderAuth",
          "name": "useapi.net API token"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.sources.every(s => s.status === 'ready' || s.status === 'error') }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Sources ready?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1320,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.useapi.net/v1/gemini-notebook/artifacts",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 320000
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ notebook: $('Create notebook').item.json.notebook, type: 'audio', mode: 'async', format: $('Settings').item.json.format, length: $('Settings').item.json.length, language: $('Settings').item.json.language }) }}"
      },
      "name": "Generate Audio Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1540,
        200
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "useapiHeaderAuth",
          "name": "useapi.net API token"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 20
      },
      "name": "Wait 20s",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1760,
        200
      ],
      "webhookId": "b3c4d5e6-7f80-4b92-8c1d-2e3f4a5b6c7d"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ 'https://api.useapi.net/v1/gemini-notebook/jobs/' + encodeURIComponent($('Generate Audio Overview').item.json.jobid) }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "name": "Check job",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1980,
        200
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "useapiHeaderAuth",
          "name": "useapi.net API token"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
                    "rightValue": "completed",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "completed"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
                    "rightValue": "failed",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "failed"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra",
          "renameFallbackOutput": "still running"
        }
      },
      "name": "Job status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        2200,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "result.files",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "One item per file",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2420,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $json.url }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "name": "Download audio",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        2640,
        100
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "useapiHeaderAuth",
          "name": "useapi.net API token"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "errorMessage": "={{ 'Audio Overview failed: ' + JSON.stringify($json.error ?? 'no reason given') }}"
      },
      "name": "Job failed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stopAndError",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2420,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Turn web pages and YouTube videos into a NotebookLM podcast\n\nPaste links, pick a format and a length, and get back a **NotebookLM Audio Overview**, the two-host podcast, as an audio file ready for the next node. It runs on your own **Gemini Notebook** (formerly NotebookLM) account through the [useapi.net Gemini Notebook API](https://useapi.net/docs/api-gemini-notebook-v1). Google's own NotebookLM API is Enterprise-only (Google Cloud licenses).\n\n### Who's it for\nNewsletter writers, educators, podcasters and content teams who want audio versions of articles, reports or videos on autopilot.\n\n### How it works\n1. A form collects a title, the links (web pages and YouTube, one per line), the podcast format and the length.\n2. The workflow creates a notebook and adds the links as sources.\n3. It waits until Google has processed every source.\n4. It generates the Audio Overview, polls the job until it is done (usually 3 to 10 minutes), and downloads the `.m4a`.\n\n### How to set up\n1. Create a useapi.net account and [API token](https://useapi.net/docs/start-here/setup-useapi), then connect your Google account with the [Gemini Notebook setup](https://useapi.net/docs/start-here/setup-gemini-notebook).\n2. Create a **Header Auth** credential. Name: `Authorization`. Value: `Bearer <your API token>`.\n3. Select the credential on the six HTTP Request nodes.\n4. Open the form URL (or click **Execute workflow**) and submit.\n\n### Requirements\n- A useapi.net subscription ($15/month flat).\n- A Google account with access to Gemini Notebook.\n\n### How to customize\n- Change `language` in **Settings** (for example `es`, `pt_BR`, `zh_Hans`).\n- Swap the form for an RSS or Schedule trigger to turn every new article into an episode.\n- Add a Google Drive, Telegram or podcast-host node after **Download audio**.",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 890
      },
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Settings\n`language` is the podcast language code. Leave `email` empty unless you connect several Google accounts and want a specific one.",
        "width": 240,
        "height": 200,
        "color": 7
      },
      "name": "Settings note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Sources first\nGoogle fetches and indexes every link before it can talk about them, so the workflow checks the notebook every 10 seconds until each source is `ready` (or `error`, which it skips).",
        "width": 760,
        "height": 150,
        "color": 7
      },
      "name": "Sources note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        620,
        500
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Audio Overview\nGeneration is asynchronous: start the job, wait, check, and loop until it is `completed` or `failed`. The finished job lists its files. The download link needs your token, so the last HTTP Request node fetches it with the same credential.",
        "width": 1120,
        "height": 150,
        "color": 7
      },
      "name": "Audio note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1520,
        400
      ]
    }
  ],
